{"seq":3,"slug":"literature-searching","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 文献检索","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/foundations/literature-searching","wordCount":2079,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-循证医学-文献检索\">研究生 循证医学 — 文献检索</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>文献检索（Literature Searching）是循证医学实践中连接临床问题与证据的关键桥梁。系统化的文献检索不是简单的关键词搜索，而是一项需要领域知识、信息科学技能和批判性判断相结合的专业活动。检索策略的质量直接决定了后续证据评价和临床决策的可靠性——漏检一项关键 RCT 可能导致完全不同的治疗推荐。Cochrane 协作网将检索方法学列为系统综述七个核心步骤之一，反映了其在证据合成中的基础性地位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"生物医学文献数据库体系\">生物医学文献数据库体系</h3><p>生物医学文献分散在多个数据库中，每个数据库有其独特的覆盖范围和索引特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>收录范围</th>\n<th>期刊数</th>\n<th>特色功能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PubMed/MEDLINE</td>\n<td>生物医学、生命科学</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 5,200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>MeSH 主题词、Clinical Queries</td>\n<td>临床研究的首选检索库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Embase</td>\n<td>生物医学、药学</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 8,500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Emtree 词表、药物不良反应丰富</td>\n<td>药物研究、系统综述补充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cochrane Library</td>\n<td>循证医学专题</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>CDSR、CENTRAL、方法学注册库</td>\n<td>系统综述和 RCT 检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web of Science</td>\n<td>多学科</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>21</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 21,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>引文追踪、期刊影响因子</td>\n<td>跨学科研究、引文分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CINAHL</td>\n<td>护理、联合健康</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 5,500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>护理特异主题词</td>\n<td>护理和康复研究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PsycINFO</td>\n<td>心理学、行为科学</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 2,500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>心理学主题词</td>\n<td>心理干预研究</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>系统综述需要检索<strong>至少两个数据库</strong>（通常为 PubMed + Embase），以减少因单一数据库覆盖不全导致的遗漏。Cochrane 方法学标准要求检索 CENTRAL + MEDLINE + Embase 作为最低检索范围。</p>\n<h3 id=\"mesh-主题词与-emtree-词表\">MeSH 主题词与 Emtree 词表</h3><p><strong>MeSH（Medical Subject Headings）</strong> 是美国国家医学图书馆维护的受控词表，以树状层级结构组织生物医学概念。MeSH 检索的核心优势在于<strong>概念检索</strong>而非字面匹配：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Heart Failure (C14.280.434)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Heart Failure, Diastolic&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Heart Failure, Systolic&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Cardiac Output, Low&quot;]&#10;    &#10;    E[Explode 功能] --&gt; F[&quot;自动纳入所有下位词&quot;]&#10;    G[Major Topic 限定] --&gt; H[&quot;仅检索以该MeSH为主要主题的文献&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Heart Failure (C14.280.434)\"] --&gt; B[\"Heart Failure, Diastolic\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Heart Failure, Systolic\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Cardiac Output, Low\"]\n    \n    E[Explode 功能] --&gt; F[\"自动纳入所有下位词\"]\n    G[Major Topic 限定] --&gt; H[\"仅检索以该MeSH为主要主题的文献\"]</pre><p>MeSH 检索示例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>&quot;Heart Failure&quot;[MeSH]</code> — 检索心衰及其所有下位概念（默认 Explode）</li>\n<li><code>&quot;Heart Failure&quot;[MeSH:NoExp]</code> — 仅检索心衰本身，不包含下位词</li>\n<li><code>&quot;Heart Failure&quot;[Majr]</code> — 仅检索以心衰为主要主题（Major Topic）的文献</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Emtree</strong> 是 Embase 的词表系统，比 MeSH 更细粒度（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 个优选术语 vs. MeSH 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 30,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span>），特别是在药物术语方面更为详尽。Emtree 使用 <code>/exp</code>（Explode）和 <code>/mj</code>（Major focus）限定符。</p>\n<h3 id=\"检索策略的构建方法\">检索策略的构建方法</h3><p>高质量检索策略的构建遵循<strong>概念块法</strong>（Block Building Approach），基于 PICO 的每个元素构建独立的概念块：</p>\n<p><strong>第一步：概念分解</strong></p>\n<p>从 PICO 提取核心概念，通常使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 个概念块（C 通常不单独作为概念块）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>检索策略</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>P block</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> AND </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>I block</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> AND </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>O block</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{检索策略} = (\\text{P block}) \\mathbf{\\text{ AND }} (\\text{I block}) \\mathbf{\\text{ AND }} (\\text{O block})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">检索策略</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P block</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> AND </span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I block</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> AND </span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O block</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>第二步：同义词扩展</strong></p>\n<p>每个概念块内使用 OR 连接所有同义词和相关术语，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>受控词表术语（MeSH/Emtree）</li>\n<li>自由词（标题/摘要中的关键词）</li>\n<li>拼写变体、缩写、商品名</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>P block</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> OR </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> OR </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> OR </mtext><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{P block} = (MeSH_P) \\text{ OR } (FreeText_{P1}) \\text{ OR } (FreeText_{P2}) \\text{ OR } \\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P block</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> OR </span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> OR </span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> OR </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>第三步：检索过滤器</strong></p>\n<p>方法学过滤器（Search Filters）是预先验证的检索策略，用于限定研究类型。例如 Cochrane 的高敏感度 RCT 过滤器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"(randomized controlled trial[pt] OR controlled clinical trial[pt] OR&#10;randomized[tiab] OR placebo[tiab] OR drug therapy[sh] OR randomly[tiab]&#10;OR trial[tiab] OR groups[tiab]) NOT (animals[mh] NOT humans[mh])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(randomized controlled trial[pt] OR controlled clinical trial[pt] OR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>randomized[tiab] OR placebo[tiab] OR drug therapy[sh] OR randomly[tiab]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>OR trial[tiab] OR groups[tiab]) NOT (animals[mh] NOT humans[mh])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>该过滤器的敏感度达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>99</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">99\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99%</span></span></span></span></span>，但精确度较低（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12%</span></span></span></span></span>），适用于系统综述的全面检索。</p>\n<h3 id=\"敏感度与精确度的平衡\">敏感度与精确度的平衡</h3><p>检索策略的评价围绕两个核心指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>敏感度（Sensitivity/Recall）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{敏感度（Sensitivity/Recall）} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">敏感度（</span><span class=\"mord\">Sensitivity/Recall</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>精确度（Precision/PPV）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{精确度（Precision/PPV）} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">精确度（</span><span class=\"mord\">Precision/PPV</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为正确检索到的相关文献，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为遗漏的相关文献，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为检索到的不相关文献。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检索目标</th>\n<th>敏感度要求</th>\n<th>精确度要求</th>\n<th>策略特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统综述</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 5\\text{--}20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>宽泛检索 + 多数据库 + 灰色文献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临床决策</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 30\\text{--}50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>聚焦检索 + 方法学过滤器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速评价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>精确检索 + 单数据库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>敏感度和精确度通常呈反比关系——追求全面（高敏感度）必然检出大量不相关文献（低精确度），反之亦然。系统综述优先保证敏感度（宁可多检不可遗漏），临床点对点查询则优先保证精确度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"灰色文献与检索偏倚控制\">灰色文献与检索偏倚控制</h3><p>灰色文献（Grey Literature）指未通过常规学术出版渠道发表的研究，包括会议摘要、学位论文、临床试验注册、监管文件和技术报告。纳入灰色文献对系统综述至关重要，因为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>阳性结果的研究更容易发表（发表偏倚），忽略灰色文献可能高估治疗效果</li>\n<li>行业资助的试验更可能选择性报告有利结局</li>\n</ul>\n<p>灰色文献来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ClinicalTrials.gov / WHO ICTRP</strong>：已注册临床试验及其结果</li>\n<li><strong>ProQuest Dissertations</strong>：学位论文全文数据库</li>\n<li><strong>OpenGrey / NTIS</strong>：欧洲/美国灰色文献数据库</li>\n<li><strong>FDA/EMA 审评报告</strong>：药品审批的完整数据包</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"补充检索方法\">补充检索方法</h3><p>除数据库检索外，系统综述还应采用以下补充检索方法以提高完整性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>预期发现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引文追踪（前向）</td>\n<td>通过 Web of Science/Scopus 查找引用了关键文献的后续研究</td>\n<td>发现更新的相关研究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参考文献追溯（后向）</td>\n<td>检查纳入文献的参考文献列表</td>\n<td>发现检索策略遗漏的早期研究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手工检索</td>\n<td>逐卷浏览核心期刊目录</td>\n<td>发现数据库未收录或索引错误的文献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专家咨询</td>\n<td>联系领域专家获取未发表或在研的数据</td>\n<td>发现正在进行的研究和灰色文献</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"检索策略的文档化与可重复性\">检索策略的文档化与可重复性</h3><p>PRISMA（Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses）2020 声明要求完整报告检索策略，包括：每个数据库的完整检索式、检索日期、结果数量、以及 PRISMA 流程图展示筛选过程。</p>\n<p>PRISMA-S（PRISMA for Searching）扩展为检索报告提供了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 项清单条目，涵盖数据库选择理由、检索策略开发过程、同行评审（PRESS 清单）等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>为以下 PICO 问题构建完整的 PubMed 检索策略（包括 MeSH 词和自由词）：&quot;对于接受 PCI 治疗的急性心肌梗死患者（P），替格瑞洛（I）相比氯吡格雷（C）在 12 个月主要不良心血管事件（MACE）方面的疗效（O）如何？&quot;</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>你为一篇系统综述设计了检索策略，在 PubMed 中检出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>847</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2,847</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">847</span></span></span></span></span> 篇文献，经标题/摘要筛选后纳入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23</span></span></span></span></span> 篇进行全文评价。如果你知道该领域约有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 篇符合标准的 RCT，请估算你的检索敏感度和精确度，并讨论如何改进。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么仅使用自由词检索 <code>&quot;heart failure&quot;[tiab]</code> 而不结合 MeSH 词 <code>&quot;Heart Failure&quot;[MeSH]</code> 可能遗漏重要文献。给出至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 种可能遗漏的情况。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在资源受限的临床环境中（例如没有 Embase 访问权限），如何调整检索策略以在单一数据库（PubMed）中尽可能接近全面检索的效果？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Lefebvre, C. et al. (2022)</strong>：Cochrane Handbook Chapter 4 &quot;Searching for and Selecting Studies&quot;——系统综述文献检索方法学的权威参考</li>\n<li><strong>McGowan, J. et al. (2016)</strong>：&quot;PRESS Peer Review of Electronic Search Strategies&quot;，Journal of Clinical Epidemiology——检索策略同行评审清单</li>\n<li><strong>Bramer, W.M. et al. (2017)</strong>：&quot;De-duplication of Database Search Results for Systematic Reviews in EndNote&quot;，JMLA——多数据库去重的实用方法</li>\n<li><strong>Page, M.J. et al. (2021)</strong>：&quot;PRISMA 2020 Statement&quot;，BMJ——系统综述报告标准最新版</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>文献检索是循证实践中将临床问题转化为可用证据的技术核心。高质量检索策略需要在敏感度与精确度之间找到适当平衡，综合运用受控词表和自由词，覆盖多个数据库和灰色文献来源，并辅以引文追踪等补充方法。检索策略的完整文档化和可重复性是系统综述方法学质量的重要保障，PRISMA-S 为此提供了标准化的报告框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 循证医学 — 文献检索","id":"研究生-循证医学-文献检索"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"生物医学文献数据库体系","id":"生物医学文献数据库体系"},{"level":3,"text":"MeSH 主题词与 Emtree 词表","id":"mesh-主题词与-emtree-词表"},{"level":3,"text":"检索策略的构建方法","id":"检索策略的构建方法"},{"level":3,"text":"敏感度与精确度的平衡","id":"敏感度与精确度的平衡"},{"level":3,"text":"灰色文献与检索偏倚控制","id":"灰色文献与检索偏倚控制"},{"level":3,"text":"补充检索方法","id":"补充检索方法"},{"level":3,"text":"检索策略的文档化与可重复性","id":"检索策略的文档化与可重复性"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 循证医学 — 临床问题构建","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/foundations/clinical-question-formulation"},"next":{"title":"研究生 循证医学 — 随机对照试验的批判性评价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/critical-appraisal/appraising-rcts"}}